# Normalize line endings: LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks text files out as CRLF, which
# makes `make check-generate` report phantom modifications (the generator writes LF)
# and makes `gofmt -l` flag every Go file for the wrong reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending convert real binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
